              "id": "3d70e37a-24f8-46b0-982e-4a71fbca41bb",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<em><strong>The God Game</strong></em> was written by Fr. Leo Booth, published by Stillpoint Publishing, September 1, 1994."
            },
            {
              "id": "582470d1-9087-4211-800d-d690639deaa4",
