            {
              "id": "b472cd31-4320-42bf-8886-dbf17261ca13",
              "type": "quote",
              "html": "<em>Challenging established religious tenets such as belief in a distant, omnipotent deity and the concept of the clergy as shepherds leading the flock, an Episcopal priest offers an alternative approach--creating a personal relationship with God.</em>"
